  "title": "Evotec closes sale of Just – Evotec Biologics’ Toulouse site to Sandoz",
  "summary": "Evotec SE today announced the closing of its previously reported sale of the Just – Evotec Biologics Toulouse site plus an indefinite technology license to Evotec’s continuous manufacturing platform technology to Sandoz AG, effective 05 December 2025. In total, potential payments may exceed US$ 650 m plus royalties on a portfolio of up to 10 biosimilar molecules, of which six have an originator net sales value of US$ 90 bn. Read full press release here.",
